	"data": "Steam Frame — Skill Tree Plan\n\nVision\n\nBecome an expert developer and tinkerer for the Steam Frame — Valve's standalone VR headset running SteamOS on ARM64. This means building standalone VR apps, understanding SteamOS/Holo Core internals, mastering the compatibility stack (Proton/FEX/Lepton), developing for OpenXR on the Frame, streaming PC VR, building accessories/modules, and modifying/extending the OS itself.\n\nChris is not starting from zero. He has a detailed study doc…",
